  "raw_text": "To prevent the fused prompt from silently drifting from the real operator logic, each logos operator was refactored to expose a parse() function so the operators remain the single source of truth. The fused pass injects allowed enum values from coordinates.json at import and reuses each operator's own result-to-coordinate mapping, including structural's scale coercion, so its output is byte-identical to the per-operator path and downstream consumers read it unchanged. This established the discipline that the fused convenience layer must never duplicate or diverge from the authoritative per-dimension mappings.",
